  <entry>
    <title>Gentoo体验</title>
    <link href="/2025/02/08/Gentoo/"/>
    <url>/2025/02/08/Gentoo/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="安装参考"><a href="#安装参考" class="headerlink" title="安装参考"></a>安装参考</h1><ul><li><a href="https://litterhougelangley.club/blog/2021/05/21/gentoo/">Gentoo 安装 – Houge’s Madness Blog</a></li><li><a href="https://wiki.gentoo.org/wiki/Handbook:AMD64/Installation/About/zh-cn">关于Gentoo Linux的安装 - Gentoo Wiki</a></li></ul><h1 id="Zram"><a href="#Zram" class="headerlink" title="Zram"></a>Zram</h1><p>该笔记本配置为i5Gen9，内存16G；配置<a href="https://wiki.gentoo.org/wiki/Zram#Using_systemd_zram-generator">Zram</a>比swap体验更好。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">Wakin ~ &gt; <span class="hljs-built_in">cat</span> /etc/systemd/zram-generator.conf<br>[zram0]<br>zram-size = ram/2<br>compression-algorithm = zstd<br>swap-priority = 100<br>fs-type = swap<br><br>Wakin ~ &gt; <span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> 150 | <span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">tee</span> /proc/sys/vm/swappiness<br><br>Wakin ~ &gt; sysctl -p<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="CachyOS相关的优化"><a href="#CachyOS相关的优化" class="headerlink" title="CachyOS相关的优化"></a>CachyOS相关的优化</h1><p>在<a href="https://github.com/CachyOS/CachyOS-Settings/blob/master/README.md">CachyOS-Settings</a>偷的一些udev规则</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">30-zram.rules<br>TEST!=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;/dev/zram0&quot;</span>, GOTO=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;zram_end&quot;</span><br>SYSCTL&#123;vm.swappiness&#125;=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;150&quot;</span><br>LABEL=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;zram_end&quot;</span><br><br><br>40-hpet-permissions.rules<br>KERNEL==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;rtc0&quot;</span>, GROUP=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;audio&quot;</span><br>KERNEL==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;hpet&quot;</span>, GROUP=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;audio&quot;</span><br><br><br>50-sata.rules<br>ACTION==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;add&quot;</span>, SUBSYSTEM==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;scsi_host&quot;</span>, KERNEL==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;host*&quot;</span>, \<br>    ATTR&#123;link_power_management_policy&#125;==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;*&quot;</span>, \<br>    ATTR&#123;link_power_management_policy&#125;=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;max_performance&quot;</span><br><br><br>69-hdparm.rules<br>ACTION==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;add|change&quot;</span>, KERNEL==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;sd[a-z]&quot;</span>, ATTR&#123;queue/rotational&#125;==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;1&quot;</span>, \<br>    RUN+=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;/usr/bin/hdparm -B 254 -S 0 /dev/%k&quot;</span><br><br><br>71-nvidia.rules<br><span class="hljs-comment"># Enable runtime PM for NVIDIA VGA/3D controller devices on driver bind</span><br>ACTION==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;add|bind&quot;</span>, SUBSYSTEM==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;pci&quot;</span>, DRIVERS==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;nvidia&quot;</span>, \<br>    ATTR&#123;vendor&#125;==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;0x10de&quot;</span>, ATTR&#123;class&#125;==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;0x03[0-9]*&quot;</span>, \<br>    TEST==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;power/control&quot;</span>, ATTR&#123;power/control&#125;=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;auto&quot;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># Disable runtime PM for NVIDIA VGA/3D controller devices on driver unbind</span><br>ACTION==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;remove|unbind&quot;</span>, SUBSYSTEM==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;pci&quot;</span>, DRIVERS==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;nvidia&quot;</span>, \<br>    ATTR&#123;vendor&#125;==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;0x10de&quot;</span>, ATTR&#123;class&#125;==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;0x03[0-9]*&quot;</span>, \<br>    TEST==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;power/control&quot;</span>, ATTR&#123;power/control&#125;=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;on&quot;</span><br><br><br>80-ntfs3-by-default.rules<br>SUBSYSTEM==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;block&quot;</span>, TEST!=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;/usr/bin/ntfs-3g&quot;</span>, ENV&#123;ID_FS_TYPE&#125;==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;ntfs&quot;</span>, ENV&#123;ID_FS_TYPE&#125;=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;ntfs3&quot;</span><br><br><br>99-cpu-dma-latency.rules<br>DEVPATH==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;/devices/virtual/misc/cpu_dma_latency&quot;</span>, OWNER=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;root&quot;</span>, GROUP=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;audio&quot;</span>, MODE=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;0660&quot;</span><br><br><br>99-ntsync.rules<br>KERNEL==<span class="hljs-string">&quot;ntsync&quot;</span>, MODE=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;0644&quot;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment">## 应用新规则</span><br>&gt; <span class="hljs-built_in">cp</span> -r rule/ /usr/lib/udev/rules.d/<br>&gt; udevadm control --reload <br>&gt; udevadm trigger<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="Kernel"><a href="#Kernel" class="headerlink" title="Kernel"></a>Kernel</h1><p>自己裁剪内核、打Patch，也可以最大化自己的需求。建议是直接在<code>gentoo-kernel</code>的默认配置文件上修修改改，删一删自己不需要的<code>fs</code> <code>device</code>。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment">## 二进制内核</span><br>Wakin ~ &gt; systemd-analyze<br>Startup finished <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> 12.052s (firmware) + 2.558s (loader) + 1.112s (kernel) + 2.379s (initrd) + 2.783s (userspace) = 20.885s<br>graphical.target reached after 2.687s <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> userspace.<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">## 发行版内核</span><br>Wakin ~ <span class="hljs-comment"># systemd-analyze</span><br>Startup finished <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> 4.045s (firmware) + 2.426s (loader) + 1.202s (kernel) + 2.335s (initrd) + 2.762s (userspace) = 12.772s<br>graphical.target reached after 2.650s <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> userspace.<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">## 精简掉一些驱动 还是快了一点点 哈哈哈哈</span><br>Wakin ~ <span class="hljs-comment"># systemd-analyze</span><br>Startup finished <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> 2.511s (firmware) + 2.490s (loader) + 1.086s (kernel) + 2.158s (initrd) + 2.604s (userspace) = 10.851s<br>graphical.target reached after 2.462s <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> userspace.<br>Wakin ~ <span class="hljs-comment"># uname -r</span><br>6.13.2-WakinGentoo<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="使用Cachyos-kernel"><a href="#使用Cachyos-kernel" class="headerlink" title="使用Cachyos-kernel"></a>使用Cachyos-kernel</h2><p>关于内核选项，可以使用<a href="https://wiki.gentoo.org/wiki/Modprobed-db">modprobd-db</a>来简化内核</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">14:04:10 127 ~&gt; <span class="hljs-built_in">cat</span> /etc/portage/package.use/localUse | grep -i cachyos<br>sys-kernel/cachyos-sources autofdo bbr3 bore hugepage_always hz_ticks_1000 kcfi llvm-lto-thin o3 per-gov hugepage_always preempt_full propeller mskylake -auto-cpu-optimization<br><br>14:04:25 0 ~&gt; <span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> emerge sys-kernel/cachyos-sources<br>19:35:56 0 ~&gt; <span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span> /usr/src/linux-6.13.5-cachyos/<br><br>14:04:34 0 /usr/src/linux-6.13.5-cachyos&gt; <span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> make -j8<br><span class="hljs-comment">## KBUILD_CFLAGS=&quot;-march=skylake -flto -O3&quot; make -j 8</span><br>14:30:52 0 /usr/src/linux-6.13.5-cachyos&gt; <span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> make modules_install -j8<br><span class="hljs-comment">## KBUILD_CFLAGS=&quot;-march=skylake -flto -O3&quot; make -j8 modules_install</span><br>14:35:25 0 /usr/src/linux-6.13.5-cachyos&gt; <span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> make install -j8<br><span class="hljs-comment">## KBUILD_CFLAGS=&quot;-march