gentoo-dist.img          kernel-6.13.5-gentoo-dist<br>Samuel ~ <span class="hljs-comment"># sudo grub-mkconfig -o /boot/grub/grub.cfg</span><br>正在生成 grub 配置文件 ...<br>找到主题：/usr/share/grub/themes/Elegant-mojave-window-left-dark/theme.txt<br>找到 Linux 镜像：/boot/kernel-6.13.5-gentoo-dist<br>找到 initrd 镜像：/boot/initramfs-6.13.5-gentoo-dist.img<br>找到 Linux 镜像：/boot/kernel-6.13.5-cachyos-WakinGentoo<br>找到 initrd 镜像：/boot/initramfs-6.13.5-cachyos-WakinGentoo.img<br>警告： os-prober 将运行以检测其它可引导分区。<br>将使用 os-prober 的输出，以检测分区中可引导的二进制文件，并为其创建新的启动项。<br>发现了 Windows Boot Manager，位于 /dev/nvme0n1p1@/efi/Microsoft/Boot/bootmgfw.efi<br>正在添加 UEFI 固件设置的引导菜单项……<br>完成<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="Proxy"><a href="#Proxy" class="headerlink" title="Proxy"></a>Proxy</h1><p><code>Dae</code> or <code>Daed</code></p><h2 id="Configure"><a href="#Configure" class="headerlink" title="Configure"></a>Configure</h2><p>DNS</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">upstream &#123;<br>    googledns: <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;tcp+udp://dns.google:53&#x27;</span><br>    alidns: <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;udp://dns.alidns.com:53&#x27;</span><br>&#125;<br>routing &#123;<br>    request &#123;<br>        qname(geosite:cn) -&gt; alidns<br>    fallback: googledns<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>Routing</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">pname(NetworkManager) -&gt; direct<br>dip(224.0.0.0/3, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;ff00::/8&#x27;</span>) -&gt; direct<br>l4proto(udp) &amp;&amp; dport(443) -&gt; block<br>dip(geoip:private) -&gt; direct<br>dip(geoip:cn) -&gt; direct<br>domain(geosite:cn) -&gt; direct<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># custom</span><br>dip(8.8.8.8, 114.114.114.114, 223.5.5.5) -&gt; direct<br>domain(suffix: dns.alidns.com, dns.google) -&gt; direct<br><br>fallback: proxy<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="scx-scheduler"><a href="#scx-scheduler" class="headerlink" title="scx_scheduler"></a>scx_scheduler</h1><p>基于BPF的可动态修改的调度器<a href="https://wiki.archlinuxcn.org/wiki/Scx-scheds#%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E5%92%8C%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5">scx</a></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">16:27:16 0 ~&gt; <span class="hljs-built_in">cat</span> /etc/scx_loader.toml <br>default_sched = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;scx_lavd&quot;</span><br>default_mode = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;LowLatency&quot;</span><br><br>16:29:19 0 ~&gt; systemctl <span class="hljs-built_in">enable</span> --now scx_loader.service<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    
